flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/HR or Admin selects period/]
    B --> C{Period ID exists?}
    C -- No --> D[/Show select-period error/]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -- Yes --> E[Calculate each active employee]
    E --> F[Replace all records for period]
    F --> G[(localStorage payrollRecords)]
    G --> H[Set period PROCESSING]
    H --> I{Submit to Admin?}
    I -- No --> J[/Remain in review/]
    I -- Yes --> K[Set PENDING_APPROVAL]
    K --> L{Current role Admin?}
    L -- No --> M[/Reject approval/]
    L -- Yes --> N[Set records APPROVED]
    N --> O[Record payment]
    O --> P([End])
    J --> P
    M --> P
